* Quarters

# The rhythm layer: they say how much space each movement takes, not what
# happens in it. Closing the first quarter may land anywhere from 20 to 25 %.
# If one quarter runs to twice the length of the others, you have a rhythm
# problem even if the content is right.

- I Setup (0–25 %) ::
  # Closes on: crossing the threshold
- II Reaction (25–50 %) ::
  # Closes on: midpoint
- III Action (50–75 %) ::
  # Closes on: apparent defeat
- IV Resolution (75–100 %) ::
  # Closes on: moral decision and new equilibrium

